      "original_function": "static int feas(int tok, int skip) {\n    int hist[5] = {0, 0, 0, 0, 0};\n    for (int i = 0; i < nopened; ++i) {\n        int q = opened[i]; if (q == skip) continue;\n        hist[5 - pc5(phm[q])]++;\n    }\n    int tot = 0, left = tok;\n    for (int d = 4; d >= 1; --d) { int take = hist[d] < left ? hist[d] : left;\n        left -= take; tot += (hist[d] - take) * d; }\n    return tot <= DMAX;\n}",
      "mathematical_condition": "TOP_K_ERASURE_LOWER_BOUND <= DMAX"
    },
